  "alias": "Sanitation Sessions - Pool and Spa (3 Hour Limit)",
  "description": "Exclusive pool/spa FTR02 sanitation, 3-hour limit, no heat. Spa circulation via climate Heat with native heat source Off. Timer duration provisionally accepted; automated session commissioning in progress. Preserve operator Automatic Ownership through all sanitation paths. Existing sanitation session/native-switch gates preempt ordinary control. Restart cleanup runs only for an outstanding sanitation session, native switch or timer. On shutdown, release unclaimed sanitation pool circulation and signal the normal scheduler to reconcile immediately; preserve manual and other active claims.",
